<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;i&gt;you only need parentheses when there's a capture&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Are they not also needed where there is optionality?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Could this be (sensibly) rewritten without the parenthesis?
&lt;code&gt;
$example =~ s/hiss(es)?/leak/;
&lt;/code&gt;
To substitute &lt;i&gt;hiss/hisses&lt;/i&gt; for &lt;i&gt;leak&lt;/i&gt; but not substitute &lt;i&gt;hisse&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;hisss&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</doctext>
